             <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{A^{0}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>𝐀</mi><mn>𝟎</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{A^{0}}</annotation></semantics></math>: initial allocation <math id="alg1.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{a_{ig}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{a_{ig}\}</annotation></semantics></math> for all <math id="alg1.l4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in\mathbf{I},g\in\mathbf{G}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>𝐈</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>𝐆</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in\mathbf{I},g\in\mathbf{G}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
              
              
             <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{B_{i}(\mathbf{v}_{-i})\}_{i\in\mathbf{I}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>𝐈</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{B_{i}(\mathbf{v}_{-i})\}_{i\in\mathbf{I}}</annotation></semantics></math>: each player’s prior belief over other players’ valuations

