              <span id="alg1.l8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">initialize</span> <math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B_{i}(\mathbf{v}_{-i})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B_{i}(\mathbf{v}_{-i})</annotation></semantics></math>
<span id="alg1.l8.4" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Each agent’s prior over other agents’ valuations
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
