<section id="A7.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">G.2 </span>Proposer’s prompt</h3>

<div id="A7.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We used a Chain-of-Thought approach to elicit LLM agent’s trade proposals:</p>
</div>
<div id="A7.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<div id="A7.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx27" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
