<section id="A7.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">G.4 </span>Refined Proposing Prompt</h3>

<div id="A7.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The refined prompt first generates multiple trades proposals and uses another LLM query to choose the best one among them.</p>
</div>
